1
00:00:01,847 --> 00:00:03,098
<font color="white">辛苦了</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:03,181 --> 00:00:04,641
<font color="white">-各位辛苦了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-辛苦了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:04,725 --> 00:00:05,767
<font color="white">辛苦了</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:08,603
<font color="white">玲奈 这下今天预定的行程都结束了</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:08,687 --> 00:00:10,355
<font color="white">-我去开车过来</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:12,441 --> 00:00:16,403
<font color="white">（爸）</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:17,654 --> 00:00:22,367
<font color="white">我平时明明总是叮咛他</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">工作时没办法接电话</font></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:23,368 --> 00:00:26,538
<font color="white">玲奈 我可能发现</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:26,621 --> 00:00:27,998
<font color="white">那起复兴典礼事件的真相了</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:28,081 --> 00:00:30,459
<font color="white">奥特曼的光正是关键</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:33,462 --> 00:00:35,046
<font color="white">-玲奈 快开电视</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,465
<font color="white">动作快</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:00:36,548 --> 00:00:37,966
<font color="white">（警察遭人刺伤？）</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:00:38,049 --> 00:00:39,760
<font color="white">在淡谷中央公园</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:00:39,843 --> 00:00:42,679
<font color="white">发生一名警察遭到袭击的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:00:43,263 --> 00:00:44,723
<font color="white">遇袭的警察</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:00:44,806 --> 00:00:46,850
<font color="white">是远藤庸介警部补</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:00:46,933 --> 00:00:48,143
<font color="white">爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:00:48,226 --> 00:00:50,645
<font color="white">他疑似遭到利刃攻击</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:00:50,729 --> 00:00:53,356
<font color="white">目前身受重伤 陷入昏迷</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:00:54,274 --> 00:00:55,650
<font color="white">（远藤庸介警部补）</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:00:55,734 --> 00:00:57,778
<font color="white">这个男人是…</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:27,826 --> 00:02:29,077
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:29,161 --> 00:02:31,204
<font color="white">（嵯峨吉中央医院）</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:02:45,135 --> 00:02:49,139
<font color="white">我来见父亲远藤庸介</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">听说他在这里治疗</font></font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:02:49,222 --> 00:02:50,765
<font color="white">稍等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:02:51,766 --> 00:02:54,436
<font color="white">他应该被送来这里了</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:02:55,437 --> 00:02:56,980
<font color="white">非常抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:02:57,063 --> 00:02:59,649
<font color="white">患者现在不开放探病</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:02:59,733 --> 00:03:01,318
<font color="white">家属也不行吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:01,401 --> 00:03:03,486
<font color="white">是的 万分抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:03,570 --> 00:03:06,907
<font color="white">-可是…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你是远藤玲奈小姐对吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:08,992 --> 00:03:10,160
<font color="white">（远藤庸介）</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:10,243 --> 00:03:11,369
<font color="white">（警察）</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:11,453 --> 00:03:13,163
<font color="white">虽然他还在昏迷中</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:13,246 --> 00:03:15,457
<font color="white">不过医生说他没有生命危险</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:17,792
<font color="white">那真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:17,876 --> 00:03:22,130
<font color="white">远藤先生说他调查的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">案情终于有点眉目了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:03:22,213 --> 00:03:24,758
<font color="white">然后就突然离开警察署</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:03:24,841 --> 00:03:26,426
<font color="white">后来…</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:03:26,509 --> 00:03:30,180
<font color="white">他就在那座公园被袭击了对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:03:31,431 --> 00:03:34,851
<font color="white">远藤先生最近好像都在调查</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:03:34,935 --> 00:03:36,645
<font color="white">不是由他负责的案子</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:03:37,687 --> 00:03:40,023
<font color="white">难道他在查的是</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:03:40,106 --> 00:03:43,860
<font color="white">复兴纪念典礼时的奥特曼事件？</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:03:46,154 --> 00:03:47,364
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:03:50,909 --> 00:03:55,538
<font color="white">其实你明明就知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼不是坏人 对不对？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:03:56,248 --> 00:03:58,124
<font color="white">大家应该也是那么认为的</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:03:58,208 --> 00:04:01,127
<font color="white">因为我当时说了那种话…</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:01,670 --> 00:04:05,131
<font color="white">你有从远藤先生那里听说</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:05,215 --> 00:04:07,425
<font color="white">关于奥特曼事件的相关内容吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:08,176 --> 00:04:10,220
<font color="white">父亲会被人攻击</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:10,303 --> 00:04:12,514
<font color="white">跟那起事件有关吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:12,597 --> 00:04:14,224
<font color="white">这个嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:16,309 --> 00:04:19,396
<font color="white">这视频我其实还不能拿给你看</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:21,815
<font color="white">这是摄像头拍下的画面</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:04:23,483 --> 00:04:26,069
<font color="white">是奥特曼攻击我爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:04:30,365 --> 00:04:33,994
<font color="white">如果你能想起远藤先生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">最近有什么特殊状况</font></font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:04:34,077 --> 00:04:37,122
<font color="white">就算只是芝麻小事也行</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">可以告诉我吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:04:39,708 --> 00:04:43,211
<font color="white">我不太清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:04:45,213 --> 00:04:46,631
<font color="white">是这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:04:49,968 --> 00:04:52,095
<font color="white">关于积顿的梦？</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:04:52,178 --> 00:04:53,221
<font color="white">是的</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:04:53,805 --> 00:04:59,102
<font color="white">我的脑中最近不时会闪过</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和积顿对峙的场景</font></font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:04:59,185 --> 00:05:01,313
<font color="white">也会梦到那样的画面</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:01,396 --> 00:05:04,691
<font color="white">那到底是怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:05,442 --> 00:05:07,193
<font color="white">我不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:07,902 --> 00:05:10,864
<font color="white">但是当我开始做那些梦</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:11,573 --> 00:05:15,785
<font color="white">我就开始无法控制奥特曼的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:05:15,869 --> 00:05:17,370
<font color="white">都在同一个时期发生</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:05:17,454 --> 00:05:19,998
<font color="white">我总觉得两者之间存在某种关联性</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:05:20,081 --> 00:05:21,750
<font color="white">你想表达什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:05:21,833 --> 00:05:25,253
<font color="white">你认为早田以前跟积顿交手一事</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:05:25,337 --> 00:05:28,465
<font color="white">跟这次的事件有关吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:05:28,548 --> 00:05:30,258
<font color="white">虽然我也不清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:05:30,341 --> 00:05:34,721
<font color="white">不过觉得那场战斗隐藏着某个关键</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:05:34,804 --> 00:05:36,681
<font color="white">这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:05:37,223 --> 00:05:40,852
<font color="white">那么你去一趟嵯峨吉町吧</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:05:40,935 --> 00:05:42,270
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:05:43,813 --> 00:05:46,149
<font color="white">奥特曼和积顿对战时</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:05:46,232 --> 00:05:49,402
<font color="white">嵯峨吉町的灾情特别惨重</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:05:49,903 --> 00:05:52,280
<font color="white">现在应该仍有事故受害者住在那里</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:05:52,363 --> 00:05:54,365
<font color="white">你或许能得到什么情报</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,294
<font color="white">太郎 你在做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:06:06,377 --> 00:06:09,506
<font color="white">我打算从岚先生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">破坏的无人机位置情报</font></font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:06:09,589 --> 00:06:11,758
<font color="white">查出进次郎的所在地</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:06:12,967 --> 00:06:15,095
<font color="white">真是抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:06:15,178 --> 00:06:17,180
<font color="white">竟然要你追踪伙伴的下落</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:06:17,263 --> 00:06:19,516
<font color="white">你心里想必很不好受</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:06:19,599 --> 00:06:22,060
<font color="white">不要紧 这是我的任务</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:06:22,143 --> 00:06:25,105
<font color="white">再说我想见进次郎一面</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:06:25,188 --> 00:06:27,440
<font color="white">亲自跟他确认</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:06:27,524 --> 00:06:29,067
<font color="white">那个时候发生的事…</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:06:31,736 --> 00:06:33,363
<font color="white">诸星先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:06:35,698 --> 00:06:39,953
<font color="white">“偶像的佐山玲奈跟那小子有来往</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:06:40,036 --> 00:06:42,747
<font color="white">调查一下她身边的人”</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:06:43,248 --> 00:06:45,250
<font color="white">这是怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:06:51,548 --> 00:06:53,258
<font color="white">不论我等了多久</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:06:53,341 --> 00:06:56,261
<font color="white">他还是不联络我吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:06:59,472 --> 00:07:01,766
<font color="white">已经过两小时了呢</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:02,809 --> 00:07:04,727
<font color="white">奥特曼？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:07:04,811 --> 00:07:08,940
<font color="white">别这么警戒 我是你…</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:07:09,023 --> 00:07:12,402
<font color="white">是你攻击了我爸 对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:07:12,485 --> 00:07:13,862
<font color="white">是一场误会</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:07:13,945 --> 00:07:15,113
<font color="white">那不是我</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:07:15,196 --> 00:07:16,865
<font color="white">不然会是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:07:16,948 --> 00:07:19,242
<font color="white">我认为大概是…</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:07:19,325 --> 00:07:21,995
<font color="white">-我想起来了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-外表跟我长得很像的…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:07:22,078 --> 00:07:25,832
<font color="white">你以前也试图扮成奥特曼赚钱吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:07:25,915 --> 00:07:27,625
<font color="white">不 那是因为…</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:07:27,709 --> 00:07:29,836
<font color="white">-父女都提到同样的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-也就是说…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:07:29,919 --> 00:07:31,754
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:07:31,838 --> 00:07:32,797
<font color="white">你知道了什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:07:32,881 --> 00:07:36,176
<font color="white">你是奥特曼的冒牌货吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:07:36,259 --> 00:07:37,594
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:07:39,345 --> 00:07:40,805
<font color="white">真伤脑筋</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:07:40,889 --> 00:07:43,808
<font color="white">那么看来我别无选择了</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:07:49,022 --> 00:07:51,149
<font color="white">我是北斗星司</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:07:51,232 --> 00:07:53,818
<font color="white">幸会啊 远藤玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:07:54,652 --> 00:07:56,654
<font color="white">很高兴见到你</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:07:57,489 --> 00:07:59,824
<font color="white">你怎么知道我的真名？</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:07:59,908 --> 00:08:01,784
<font color="white">我听说了很多关于你的事</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:08:01,868 --> 00:08:04,370
<font color="white">你是早田学长的女友 对吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:08:04,454 --> 00:08:06,456
<font color="white">进次郎吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:08:06,539 --> 00:08:08,917
<font color="white">而且你还叫他“学长”？</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:12,212
<font color="white">我根本就没有男朋友啦</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:08:12,295 --> 00:08:14,297
<font color="white">我是不是太多嘴了？</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:18,051
<font color="white">总之有人交代我</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">如果你父亲出了意外</font></font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:08:18,134 --> 00:08:20,428
<font color="white">我必须帮助你</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:08:20,512 --> 00:08:22,722
<font color="white">有人交代你要帮我？</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:08:22,805 --> 00:08:24,349
<font color="white">是谁说的啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:08:24,432 --> 00:08:25,892
<font color="white">-贝姆拉</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:08:26,518 --> 00:08:28,853
<font color="white">别在意那种事了 我们走吧</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:08:28,937 --> 00:08:30,480
<font color="white">这里很危险</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:08:30,563 --> 00:08:32,649
<font color="white">我们要去哪里啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:08:34,359 --> 00:08:36,277
<font color="white">我的老家</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:08:39,447 --> 00:08:41,991
<font color="white">是啊 我记得很清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:08:42,992 --> 00:08:46,120
<font color="white">奥特曼和积顿战斗时</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:08:46,204 --> 00:08:49,666
<font color="white">这附近化为一片火海</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:08:50,166 --> 00:08:52,710
<font color="white">灾情相当严重</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:08:52,794 --> 00:08:55,338
<font color="white">原来是这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:08:55,421 --> 00:08:58,091
<font color="white">-当时吃了不少苦吧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-是啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:08:58,591 --> 00:09:02,762
<font color="white">各位对奥特曼抱持什么想法？</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:09:02,845 --> 00:09:05,932
<font color="white">我们当然都很愤怒</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:09:06,015 --> 00:09:10,019
<font color="white">毕竟我们的家园瞬间遭到破坏</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:09:10,103 --> 00:09:11,854
<font color="white">因为那场战斗</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:09:11,938 --> 00:09:16,985
<font color="white">当时的居民几乎都不住在这里了</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:09:17,068 --> 00:09:20,613
<font color="white">他们被卷入奥特曼的战斗</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因而丧生了吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:09:20,697 --> 00:09:24,534
<font color="white">不 我记得当时无人死亡</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:09:25,118 --> 00:09:27,996
<font color="white">虽然有受伤的人被送医</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:09:28,079 --> 00:09:32,458
<font color="white">每当遭逢那种状况</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">早田都会去探望受害者</font></font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:09:33,042 --> 00:09:34,669
<font color="white">-请问一下…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:09:34,752 --> 00:09:38,089
<font color="white">你知道伤患当时被送去哪间医院吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:09:38,172 --> 00:09:42,927
<font color="white">我知道 就是那间嵯峨吉中央医院</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:09:45,263 --> 00:09:47,640
<font color="white">-谢谢</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不客气</font></font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:09:56,733 --> 00:09:59,068
<font color="white">这里是什么地方？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:09:59,152 --> 00:10:01,154
<font color="white">外星人街</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:10:01,237 --> 00:10:03,239
<font color="white">政府为了住在地球的外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:10:03,323 --> 00:10:06,200
<font color="white">特别准备的地区</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:10:06,784 --> 00:10:09,203
<font color="white">与外面的世界完美隔绝</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">隐藏得很隐密</font></font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:10:09,287 --> 00:10:11,623
<font color="white">经过精心设计 不会被一般人发现</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:10:12,957 --> 00:10:15,084
<font color="white">但是这些人看起来都…</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:10:15,168 --> 00:10:17,253
<font color="white">因为大家都拟态了</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:10:17,337 --> 00:10:19,005
<font color="white">他们其实都是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:10:19,088 --> 00:10:20,798
<font color="white">北斗哥哥</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:10:21,924 --> 00:10:24,552
<font color="white">嗨 你过得好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:10:24,636 --> 00:10:27,305
<font color="white">你暂时解除拟态吧</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:10:27,388 --> 00:10:28,806
<font color="white">什么？可以解除吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:10:28,890 --> 00:10:30,516
<font color="white">-可以</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:10:32,935 --> 00:10:35,563
<font color="white">现在不用解除没关系</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:10:36,230 --> 00:10:38,483
<font color="white">什么？还真无趣</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:10:38,566 --> 00:10:39,984
<font color="white">拜拜</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:10:40,068 --> 00:10:41,402
<font color="white">拜拜</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:10:41,486 --> 00:10:43,363
<font color="white">再见</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:10:43,446 --> 00:10:47,575
<font color="white">你为什么要带我来外星人街？</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:10:49,243 --> 00:10:51,996
<font color="white">我是在这里长大的</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,582
<font color="white">我是地球人喔</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:10:54,666 --> 00:10:57,210
<font color="white">抚养我长大的就是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:01,798
<font color="white">就是这里</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:11:07,387 --> 00:11:08,554
<font color="white">怪了</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:11:08,638 --> 00:11:10,681
<font color="white">我明明说过今天要回来</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:11:10,765 --> 00:11:13,518
<font color="white">那是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:11:13,601 --> 00:11:15,103
<font color="white">等等 你要去哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:11:15,186 --> 00:11:16,854
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:11:17,355 --> 00:11:19,482
<font color="white">大家干杯吧</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:11:19,565 --> 00:11:21,984
<font color="white">-好 干杯</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-干杯</font></font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:11:29,575 --> 00:11:32,161
<font color="white">请问一下 这是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:11:32,245 --> 00:11:34,539
<font color="white">那是卢比克星的能量饮料</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:11:34,622 --> 00:11:36,666
<font color="white">-很好喝喔</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那我要买一个</font></font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:11:36,749 --> 00:11:39,252
<font color="white">-好啊</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-玲奈小姐 不要随便乱跑</font></font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:11:39,335 --> 00:11:41,212
<font color="white">-那是什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-等一下</font></font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:11:41,295 --> 00:11:42,505
<font color="white">对喔</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:11:42,588 --> 00:11:44,507
<font color="white">-叔叔 给你</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-谢谢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:11:44,590 --> 00:11:46,175
<font color="white">玲奈小姐 别乱跑</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:11:46,259 --> 00:11:48,177
<font color="white">（外星人竞技场</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">MMB锦标赛）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:11:48,261 --> 00:11:50,138
<font color="white">（格拉莫对上亚特兰）</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:11:52,181 --> 00:11:53,266
<font color="white">天啊</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:11:55,184 --> 00:11:57,728
<font color="white">真是的 玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:11:57,812 --> 00:11:59,605
<font color="white">这个看起来好有趣喔</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:11:59,689 --> 00:12:01,274
<font color="white">你不能去看</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:12:01,357 --> 00:12:03,484
<font color="white">虽然这里归政府管理</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:12:03,568 --> 00:12:06,612
<font color="white">但是几乎跟三不管地带没两样</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:12:06,696 --> 00:12:08,489
<font color="white">要是太引人注目…</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:12:08,573 --> 00:12:09,782
<font color="white">等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:12:12,618 --> 00:12:14,454
<font color="white">（嵯峨吉中央医院）</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:12:14,537 --> 00:12:15,496
<font color="white">不好意思</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:18,291
<font color="white">请问你认识这个人吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:12:19,709 --> 00:12:22,753
<font color="white">我好像有看过他</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:12:22,837 --> 00:12:24,505
<font color="white">请问他是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:12:24,589 --> 00:12:26,591
<font color="white">我不太清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:12:30,178 --> 00:12:34,390
<font color="white">我记得他好像是前外务大臣</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:12:34,474 --> 00:12:36,559
<font color="white">他是防卫大臣</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:12:36,642 --> 00:12:38,644
<font color="white">虽然已经是很久以前的事了</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:12:38,728 --> 00:12:41,647
<font color="white">你知道他曾来过这间医院吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:12:42,648 --> 00:12:44,901
<font color="white">我不晓得耶</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:12:44,984 --> 00:12:47,820
<font color="white">我在这里只工作了四年</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:12:47,904 --> 00:12:49,989
<font color="white">田中医生</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:12:50,072 --> 00:12:52,241
<font color="white">请前往第二手术室</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:12:54,035 --> 00:12:55,745
<font color="white">我认识他喔</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:12:57,622 --> 00:12:59,707
<font color="white">你指的是早田先生吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:02,084
<font color="white">就是那个科学特搜队的人</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:13:07,048 --> 00:13:08,633
<font color="white">对不起嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:13:08,716 --> 00:13:13,095
<font color="white">我第一次来这种地方 太兴奋了</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:13:13,179 --> 00:13:14,555
<font color="white">你是小孩子吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:13:15,139 --> 00:13:16,807
<font color="white">我说不定…</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:13:16,891 --> 00:13:19,018
<font color="white">还是小孩子</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:13:21,437 --> 00:13:25,441
<font color="white">我很小的时候妈妈就过世了</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:13:25,525 --> 00:13:27,568
<font color="white">我爸工作很忙</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:13:27,652 --> 00:13:29,862
<font color="white">我总是孤零零的</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:13:31,739 --> 00:13:34,534
<font color="white">我这样很奇怪吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:13:34,617 --> 00:13:37,787
<font color="white">父亲明明遇到严重的意外</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我还表现得这样</font></font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:13:53,636 --> 00:13:55,471
<font color="white">对了</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:13:56,347 --> 00:13:57,807
<font color="white">这给你吧</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:13:58,933 --> 00:14:00,226
<font color="white">这是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:14:00,309 --> 00:14:03,104
<font color="white">贝姆拉要我转交给你父亲</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:14:03,187 --> 00:14:05,356
<font color="white">我只知道这么多</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:14:05,439 --> 00:14:09,735
<font color="white">这怎么看都是颈链吧</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:14:10,319 --> 00:14:12,822
<font color="white">给你保管吧</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:14:14,615 --> 00:14:16,993
<font color="white">尺寸对我来说刚刚好</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:14:17,076 --> 00:14:19,495
<font color="white">这好像不适合我爸</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:14:19,579 --> 00:14:21,330
<font color="white">怎么样啊？好看吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:14:21,414 --> 00:14:23,749
<font color="white">我觉得很适合你</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:14:25,501 --> 00:14:29,046
<font color="white">对了 下面的洗手间有镜子可以看</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:14:29,130 --> 00:14:30,298
<font color="white">好主意</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:14:30,381 --> 00:14:33,259
<font color="white">好 我去确认看看</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:14:39,515 --> 00:14:40,725
<font color="white">井手先生</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:14:40,808 --> 00:14:41,726
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:14:41,809 --> 00:14:43,853
<font color="white">我调查了佐山玲奈这名偶像</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:14:43,936 --> 00:14:45,730
<font color="white">有什么发现吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:14:45,813 --> 00:14:47,857
<font color="white">她的父亲是…</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:14:48,441 --> 00:14:49,525
<font color="white">“警部补”？</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:14:49,609 --> 00:14:50,443
<font color="white">（远藤庸介）</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:14:50,526 --> 00:14:51,611
<font color="white">嗯？</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:14:51,694 --> 00:14:54,030
<font color="white">他是昨天遇袭的警察吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:14:54,113 --> 00:14:56,866
<font color="white">对 但是不只那样</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:14:57,408 --> 00:14:58,951
<font color="white">这是…</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:14:59,535 --> 00:15:02,204
<font color="white">这是我从不法途径取得的照片</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:15:02,288 --> 00:15:04,373
<font color="white">这件奥特曼装甲…</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:15:04,457 --> 00:15:05,917
<font color="white">是北斗？</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:15:07,126 --> 00:15:09,587
<font color="white">他不可能做出这种事</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:15:10,963 --> 00:15:13,674
<font color="white">不过现在的问题是</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:15:13,758 --> 00:15:17,929
<font color="white">我们还没有接收到这项信息</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:15:18,471 --> 00:15:20,139
<font color="white">没错吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:15:20,222 --> 00:15:24,310
<font color="white">看来他们在提防科学特搜队</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:15:24,393 --> 00:15:26,395
<font color="white">似乎是那样</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:15:27,021 --> 00:15:28,397
<font color="white">井手先生</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:15:28,481 --> 00:15:32,401
<font color="white">我打算去一趟</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">远藤刑警接受治疗的医院</font></font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:15:32,902 --> 00:15:33,903
<font color="white">为什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:15:34,487 --> 00:15:39,158
<font color="white">我认为到那边后 有机会遇到进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:15:45,456 --> 00:15:48,751
<font color="white">星星的碎片</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:15:51,253 --> 00:15:52,672
<font color="white">奇怪</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:15:53,422 --> 00:15:54,590
<font color="white">这是怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:15:55,716 --> 00:15:57,718
<font color="white">颈链在发光</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:16:05,059 --> 00:16:06,185
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:16:08,354 --> 00:16:13,526
<font color="white">早田先生来这里</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">已经是将近20年前的事了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:16:14,735 --> 00:16:16,404
<font color="white">对了 还有啊</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:16:16,487 --> 00:16:19,907
<font color="white">奥特曼最后在这一带打斗</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:16:19,991 --> 00:16:22,827
<font color="white">我们当时收治许多遭受波及的伤患</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:16:22,910 --> 00:16:25,579
<font color="white">早田先生怎么会来这里？</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:16:26,914 --> 00:16:31,377
<font color="white">那场战役结束后</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">外星人和怪兽不再来地球</font></font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:16:32,086 --> 00:16:34,797
<font color="white">在另一方面 那场战斗</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">却酿成严重的灾情</font></font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:16:36,173 --> 00:16:41,303
<font color="white">所以老实说大家对</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">科学特搜队没什么好感</font></font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:16:43,597 --> 00:16:46,392
<font color="white">在那样的状况下 早田先生他啊</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:16:46,475 --> 00:16:48,894
<font color="white">还到处去跟事故受害人低头道歉</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:16:48,978 --> 00:16:51,230
<font color="white">他甚至没有搬出任何借口</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:16:51,814 --> 00:16:53,024
<font color="white">不只是那样</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:16:53,107 --> 00:16:55,943
<font color="white">那场战斗造成一名孕妇受伤</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:16:56,027 --> 00:16:58,446
<font color="white">对方需要输血时</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:16:58,529 --> 00:17:01,365
<font color="white">早田先生第一个站出来捐血</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:17:02,033 --> 00:17:05,745
<font color="white">那明明不是科学特搜队的错</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:17:05,828 --> 00:17:09,790
<font color="white">当时我非常惊讶</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">他竟做到那种地步 让我印象深刻</font></font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:17:10,708 --> 00:17:13,335
<font color="white">原来是那样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:17:15,296 --> 00:17:18,549
<font color="white">若目小姐 波野医生在找你</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:17:18,632 --> 00:17:20,468
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:17:21,844 --> 00:17:26,098
<font color="white">那么我该回去工作了</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:17:26,724 --> 00:17:28,309
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:17:44,116 --> 00:17:46,744
<font color="white">到底是怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:17:46,827 --> 00:17:48,162
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:17:48,245 --> 00:17:49,705
<font color="white">你没事吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:17:50,456 --> 00:17:51,874
<font color="white">我没事</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:17:51,957 --> 00:17:55,753
<font color="white">话说你怎么又变身成奥特曼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:17:55,836 --> 00:17:58,672
<font color="white">这个嘛 你想知道答案？</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:18:02,343 --> 00:18:05,763
<font color="white">因为我有事情要问你</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:18:05,846 --> 00:18:09,183
<font color="white">告诉我奥特曼在哪里</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:18:09,850 --> 00:18:14,063
<font color="white">我怎么可能知道</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:18:14,146 --> 00:18:15,439
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:18:15,523 --> 00:18:17,149
<font color="white">给我放开她</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:21,946
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:18:22,029 --> 00:18:23,447
<font color="white">那家伙是冒牌货</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:18:23,531 --> 00:18:25,991
<font color="white">也是攻击你父亲的犯人</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:18:26,075 --> 00:18:27,201
<font color="white">攻击我爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:18:27,284 --> 00:18:29,203
<font color="white">说得没错</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:18:29,745 --> 00:18:33,415
<font color="white">你以为能把她藏匿在这里吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:18:33,499 --> 00:18:35,126
<font color="white">但很遗憾</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:18:35,209 --> 00:18:38,212
<font color="white">我也是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:18:40,005 --> 00:18:44,176
<font color="white">我确实是有点大意了</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:19:08,909 --> 00:19:10,119
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:19:18,127 --> 00:19:20,921
<font color="white">玲奈小姐 趁现在快逃 动作快</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:19:21,005 --> 00:19:22,089
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:19:42,401 --> 00:19:43,235
<font color="white">惨了</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:19:52,077 --> 00:19:53,204
<font color="white">北斗</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:19:53,287 --> 00:19:54,872
<font color="white">你快逃</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:01,837
<font color="white">可恶啊</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:20:23,317 --> 00:20:25,694
<font color="white">你在做什么？快逃啊</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:20:25,778 --> 00:20:27,029
<font color="white">北斗</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:20:27,738 --> 00:20:29,365
<font color="white">不要担心</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:20:29,448 --> 00:20:31,367
<font color="white">我不是来找这家伙的</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:20:31,450 --> 00:20:35,621
<font color="white">为了防止他阻碍我</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我只是让他吃点苦头</font></font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:20:39,667 --> 00:20:42,336
<font color="white">天啊 你要回去了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:20:43,003 --> 00:20:44,171
<font color="white">是的</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:20:45,381 --> 00:20:47,841
<font color="white">请问一下 我爸…</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:20:48,509 --> 00:20:51,637
<font color="white">早田先生什么时候</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">才不再拜访这间医院？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:20:52,221 --> 00:20:54,974
<font color="white">直到所有受害的伤患都出院为止</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:20:55,683 --> 00:20:57,518
<font color="white">刚刚提到的孕妇…</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:20:57,601 --> 00:20:59,103
<font color="white">这个嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:20:59,186 --> 00:21:02,314
<font color="white">那个人最后没有撑过去</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:21:02,982 --> 00:21:07,403
<font color="white">但她生下了健康的女婴</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">可以说是不幸中的大幸</font></font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:21:07,486 --> 00:21:08,570
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:21:10,614 --> 00:21:13,951
<font color="white">母亲生下我后随即逝世</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:21:14,702 --> 00:21:18,122
<font color="white">她被超人奥特曼和外星人的战斗波及</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:21:19,039 --> 00:21:21,959
<font color="white">受困在倒塌的医院…</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:21:22,543 --> 00:21:24,003
<font color="white">身亡</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:21:24,586 --> 00:21:26,046
<font color="white">难道说…</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:21:26,922 --> 00:21:29,591
<font color="white">爸救的人是…</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:21:31,552 --> 00:21:32,886
<font color="white">玲奈小姐？</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:24:05,080 --> 00:24:08,167
<font color="white">字幕翻译：梁雪莹</font><font color="white"></font>

